        "classical_preprocessing": "Computation of Trend Ratio components: FS(j) = funds_ini + Σ_i ω_i (price_i(j) − price_i(1)); DER = [Σ_j (FS(j) − funds_ini) · j] / [Σ_j j^2]; TL(j) = DER · j + funds_ini; DR = [Σ_j (FS(j) − TL(j))^2 / D] · α; construction of scalarized objective E(ω) for each λ; normalization of risk and return to [0,1] for IGD and HV metrics",
